/* Head implementation of the max-array demonstration, written by hand: imports the context
   and the max_array component. iter_services is not imported here: the implementation of
   max_array has to import it to call its operations, and a machine is imported only once. */
IMPLEMENTATION
    Systeme_max_array_i

REFINES
    Systeme_max_array

IMPORTS
    ctx,
    max_array

END
